{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1bb9867a034be7a0e104c738e57f11ecc0e4e4a42090143580b5ec37421804c", "ja": "よーし、頑張るぞ～！　事務員たる者、まずは\nスケジュール確認からしっかりやらないと……！", "zh": "好～，要加油啦～！身为主务人员，首先\n得好好确认一下日程才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "20a93e589b0f0c5d2c91d7058c8207c7aca764b47047a8b179712e487a8ea8c8", "ja": "{$P$}さんが来たら、\n予定を聞いてみようっと！", "zh": "等{$P$}先生来了之后，\n就去问问日程安排吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6a0ccb8ea31646cd4d03a2271b3bf546b8fb604b79debe16d788c06140b7651c", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n今、名前を呼ばれたような気がしたんですが……。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n刚才好像听到有人叫我的名字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "29dbc106932205932a6e59b076e48d032bcb31899b528dfa6b6345109cc28d2e", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nはい！　ナイスタイミングです♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n是的！您来得正是时候♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "43fa3852fd760d02f2fb7b722d91f38e3f4d6cf7db225a2274b4d5ec78263090", "ja": "早速ですけど、\n今日のスケジュールはどうなってますか！？", "zh": "事不宜迟，\n今天的日程安排是怎么样的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bcfa924318c77fa1d8dd373929637f4fffb6504d6efb07a1102609e20b11bde6", "ja": "えっ、スケジュールですか……？\nええと……ああ、そうだ。", "zh": "诶，行程吗……？\n呃……啊，对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "281cb2b94b7b92ad64656f6b03986125dcea03e8bc7a527a93be5a5e961334ca", "ja": "天体公演の打ち合わせがあって、社長に呼ばれて\nいるんですよね。リマインドありがとうございます！", "zh": "因为要商量天体公演的事，社长叫我\n过去一趟呢。谢谢你的提醒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "b9a204cd6e1ca097045187e456f8e1375a6f30f36a1671a6af61b74034abedd8", "ja": "いえいえ、このくらい当然です！\n事務員として！", "zh": "不用谢，这点小事是理所当然的！\n毕竟我是事务员嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "ed271549e410f946e2576870395243cb95f4efde8c1acba73541399210f3c8ed", "ja": "あ、公演ってことは、衣装も作らないと。\nそちらもバッチリ任せてくださいね！　事務員として！", "zh": "啊，说到公演，还得制作服装呢。\n那边也请放心交给我吧！作为事务员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f618afb03403d603cc12d63567577bf49ac9d419058103032d8ed5bf29440620", "ja": "はい、頼りにしてます！\nそれじゃあ、行ってきますね！", "zh": "好的，就拜托你了！\n那我先走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "8cbd74569342a27d641a2cd279cf89e59892cf6e0cd8cfe395c65c652bbcae9b", "ja": "はーい！　いってらっしゃーい！\n……うん、この調子♪", "zh": "好——！路上小心，早点回来——！\n……嗯，就保持这个状态♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0746d88c895922f72f0fa888793e39b27a77712d993f2d7641027dbb01b87692", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです！\nすみません、少し早めに着いてしまったんですが……。", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了！\n不好意思，我来得稍微早了一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "8b2762a268936825a2cf9e30a1e9b0505bfb96665f1f7a11794ca91f34fe5579", "ja": "やあ君！　構わないよ。私も早く伝えたくて、\n待ちきれなかったくらいだからね。", "zh": "嗨，是你啊！没关系哦。我也一直想早点告诉你，\n甚至都有些等不及了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bdb68b47c27137d0ff53b2cc381e6dbd68537f9c81900f92f9c2e8edc8c7ea0e", "ja": "ということは、やはり……。", "zh": "也就是说，果然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "2e5718b64464c9555e99d9ddbc7dc25b6aa34e787c939cc921e5124537adab61", "ja": "ああ。天体公演ツアーの次の企画を、\nそろそろ動かそうじゃないか！　GOだ！", "zh": "啊。天体公演巡演的下一个企划，也该差不多开始推进了！GO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "3231699460fb8fbea48b2a1bc202e725f81d7ee9c2c57d2e643bc46dc21ff758", "ja": "社長ったら、さすがは{$P$}さん、\n今回も手際がいいって、べた褒めだったんですよ？", "zh": "社长那边，果然不愧是{$P$}先生，\n说这次也处理得干净利落，夸个不停呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c89629c968dfec1fd2778ccb61b89e51bb3cdb5aad243d718f528ec945787912", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "咦，真的吗？\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "bf57b725508bd8bcecc179843a6c0a207c8aad64e71adbc246e7066929f40ba0", "ja": "言わないでくれよ、音無君！\n同じアイドルプロデュースを志す者として……。", "zh": "别这么说嘛，音无！\n同为立志制作偶像的人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "4464c018541f8bcbe5597c9bcd5b51ad0d964a109f0674d4c4913e2a44a5d171", "ja": "私と彼も、ある意味ではライバルだ！\n馴れ合ってばかりいるのも、よくないだろう？", "zh": "我和他在某种意义上也是对手！\n总是跟他套近乎，也不太好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "f774c8b4b6cb4e25d529cd8b227696a9a44e306f59489ebea310eae4ddad5a44", "ja": "まあ、どうしたんですか、急に。\n若い頃でも思い出しました？", "zh": "哎呀，这是怎么了，突然说起这个。  \n是想起年轻时候了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "6da7885269b48f9608fa25a9d2a49e0ab97549326bc5cda98586a7716f076f41", "ja": "はっはっはっ！　まあ、そんなところだ。\n次の天体ユニットは……『ルナ』だったかな？", "zh": "哈哈哈！嗯，大概就是这样。\n下一个天体组合是……“露娜”来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "84edd058b5ca20e27c2e63249da24b247ac3944aa6002267e510b1dea4eb7f54", "ja": "はい。夜空に輝く、\n月をモチーフにしたユニットです。", "zh": "是的。那是以闪耀在夜空中的月亮为主题的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "ce02380c22dc70b7012c83f8cae738ae6f7eb3f69b561a4213e5f847047ed186", "ja": "太陽とは異なる、陰のある光……。\n闇を切り裂く、圧倒的な輝き……。", "zh": "不同于太阳的、带着阴翳的光芒……。\n撕裂黑暗的、压倒性的耀目光辉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "3ec44aab5f1e87d79359b3698a3276f867eadacd9ab779cf0e72b36de5a01142", "ja": "それを体現するのは、菊地真君、如月千早君、\n三浦あずさ君、我那覇響君……うむ、実にふさわしい！", "zh": "能够体现这一点的，正是菊地真、如月千早、三浦梓、我那霸响……嗯，实在是再合适不过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "adb8af0204f71a7d8a85941198a6874d9e3aa07f25fff5aa3b73fa452919c2af", "ja": "前回の『ソル』とはまた違う輝きの、\n素敵な公演になりそうですね♪", "zh": "看来会是一场闪耀着与上次《Sol》不同光芒的精彩演出呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3794a0f7c99714927e339e4916b01e84b0287eec899aa95877c061eb59fd6cfa", "ja": "はい。見てくれる人全員が、彼女達を\n仰ぎ見てしまうような、圧倒的な公演にしてみせます！", "zh": "是的！我一定要把这场公演办得精彩绝伦，让所有观看的人都不禁仰望她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "7096511f9ed11069b4014a88fdad70444dda0eca9ece49b732b3c351965c8bb5", "ja": "その意気だ！\n素晴らしい公演を期待しているよ！", "zh": "就是这股干劲！\n期待你们带来精彩的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "70d67534a9bc6721f102ecf071853c3c3986287c978d2b0f82058bf6e9446df3", "ja": "（天体公演『ルナ』、いよいよ始動だ。\n俺も、社長に負けないつもりで頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（天体公演《月神》终于要启动了。我也要努力，不能输给社长！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
